WEBVTT

00:00:03.183 --> 00:00:07.251
Each report offers the filters that make sense for it.

00:00:07.251 --> 00:00:12.403
Call insights offers Queue group, Queue, Agent, Direction and Channel.

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:16.100
A filter left on All does not narrow the report.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.366
Pick the Support queue and the Inbound direction, and click Show.

00:00:20.817 --> 00:00:24.741
Every number is worked out again from the matching records:

00:00:24.741 --> 00:00:30.537
the cards, the breakdowns and the daily volume now describe only inbound calls to Support.

00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:33.707
Other reports have other filters.

00:00:33.707 --> 00:00:39.077
Dialer call detail filters by campaign, source, status and disposition.

00:00:39.528 --> 00:00:44.358
In Disposition you can tick several dispositions at once, to list the numbers

00:00:44.358 --> 00:00:45.988
that ended either way.

